sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Browser Client (Option A / B / Chat)
    participant FastAPI as FastAPI Router (urban_agent_server.py)
    participant Validator as Payload & EXIF Validator
    participant YOLO as Ultralytics YOLO Engine
    participant OCR as EasyOCR Engine
    participant Store as Master GIS / JSON Storage

    Note over Client,FastAPI: Execution Flow for Street Intelligence Analysis
    Client->>FastAPI: POST /api/analyze-street (file=image.png, street_code="ST01")
    FastAPI->>Validator: Validate content-type, file length, extract EXIF GPS
    Validator-->>FastAPI: Validated PIL Image + GPS coords [11.0284, 76.9741]
    
    FastAPI->>YOLO: model.predict(image, conf=0.25, imgsz=640)
    YOLO-->>FastAPI: Boxes, Class IDs (building, pole, streetlight), Confidences
    
    opt When commercial_sign is detected
        FastAPI->>OCR: reader.readtext(crop_image)
        OCR-->>FastAPI: Extracted shop text (e.g. "Sri Krishna Medicals")
    end
    
    FastAPI->>Store: Generate Asset Passports & Correlate with Corridor ST01
    Store-->>FastAPI: Enriched Asset Records & Summary Counts
    FastAPI-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK: {success: true, detections: [...], summary: {...}}

    Note over Client,FastAPI: Execution Flow for Urban AI Agent Assistant
    Client->>FastAPI: POST /api/chat {query: "How many streetlights need repair on Raja Street?"}
    FastAPI->>Store: Lookup corridor_intelligence_scorecard.csv & infill directives
    Store-->>FastAPI: Matched records for ST08 (Raja Street)
    FastAPI->>FastAPI: Synthesize Contextual Answer with Evidence Citations
    FastAPI-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK: {answer: "Raja Street (ST08) has 14 streetlights...", sources: [...]}
